WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.795
Phobos crosses the Sun.

00:02.585 --> 00:08.920
Mars's larger moon is too small to cover the Sun, so it crosses it as a dark disc in under a minute.

00:09.617 --> 00:15.509
Perseverance filmed one from here; the clock is set to the crossing the sky's own reckoning finds.
